& $\mathrm{pH}=\mathrm{p}$ K_a+$\log \frac{$[$\text{ salt }$]}{[$\text{ acid }$]} \\
& $\mathrm{CH}_3 \mathrm{COOH}+\mathrm{NaOH}$ \rightarrow $\mathrm{CH}_3 \mathrm{COONa}+\mathrm{H}_2 \mathrm{O}$\end{aligned}

Putting$ the $values, we get :

\begin{aligned}$\mathrm{pH}$ & =4.57+$\log\frac{0.10}{0.03}$ \\
\Rightarrow \quad $\mathrm{pH}$ & =5.09
\end{aligned}

